<title>FINLAND: POLAR SAYS HAS NEWS CONFERENCE AT 1030.</title>
<headline>POLAR SAYS HAS NEWS CONFERENCE AT 1030.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group Polar-yhtyma Oy will have a news conference on Friday at 1030/0730 GMT on issues, which have an impact on the company, Polar said in a statement distributed late on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Polar will have a news conference on issues, which have a significant impact on the company,&quot; Polar said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
